---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">

  <!-- The work -->
  <section class="the-work">
    <div class="the-work-inner">
      <h1>The work</h1>
      <div class="the-work-body">
        <p>I design at the system level.</p>
        <p>That means looking past the screen in front of me to the platform, the service, and the business it sits inside, then connecting those layers into something that actually works for the people using it.</p>
        <p>Currently I'm a Staff Product Designer at Intuit, where I lead end-to-end design for SalesTech and serve as the strategic AI design advisor across Sales and Customer Success. My work spans Concierge (the lead-to-expert engagement system influencing 53% of conversions and supporting ~5,500 daily calls), the Virtual Expert Platform, and broader Sales and CS initiatives. The throughline is using AI as a design material to connect workflows, data, and customer journeys into platform-level systems.</p>
        <p>Before Intuit, I led experience design across four universities and five affiliates at National University System, focused on top-of-funnel UX and lead generation. Earlier, I cut my teeth at agency work on e-commerce and B2B platforms. The common thread across every chapter: I'm at my best when I can shape direction, not just deliver pixels.</p>
        <p>I'm currently exploring Senior Staff and Staff Product Designer roles where I can shape strategic direction, build AI-native experiences, and help design grow into a real business partner.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Sizzle reel -->
  <section class="sizzle-section">
    <div class="sizzle-inner">
      <h2>A little sizzle …</h2>
      <p>This sizzle reel captures just how much we've accomplished lately, and I'm proud to have played a big part in it. From vision to execution, I've had my hands in some exciting work lately. It's been a wild, rewarding ride, and this is just a glimpse of what we've built.</p>
      <div class="sizzle-video">
        <iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1199938429?title=0&byline=0&portrait=0&autoplay=1&muted=1&loop=1" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Outside of work -->
  <section class="outside-section">
    <div class="outside-inner">
      <div class="outside-text">
        <h2>Outside of work</h2>
        <p>I'm a proud dad of three energetic boys and a dedicated Duck fan (Go Oregon!). Most weekends you'll find me at a T-ball field or trying to keep up with whatever the kids are into this month. I stay close to the San Diego design community through SD Design Trek, SDXD, UX Speakeasy, and other local meetups.</p>
        <p>Back in the day, I was a freelance photographer for the Union-Tribune, which sharpened my eye for detail and storytelling. Tech runs through my veins thanks to my A.A. in Telecommunications. I still build computers, troubleshoot IT puzzles, and geek out over hardware.</p>
        <p>On the creative side, I drum in a jam band with old colleagues, which keeps the rhythm (and sanity) alive. And for a bit of intergalactic fun, I'm part of the 501st Legion, the infamous "bad guys who do good" of Star Wars cosplay. Creativity and community come in a lot of shapes... and galaxies.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="outside-photo-small">
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/jared-bob-ross.jpg" alt="Halloween 2024: My homage to Bob Ross" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Halloween 2024: My homage to Bob Ross</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Full-width photo banner -->
  <div class="outside-banner">
    <img src="/images/jared-officer.jpg" alt="Me leading the troops at the Vista Holiday Parade" loading="lazy" />
    <div class="outside-banner-text">
      <p>Me leading the troops at the Vista Holiday Parade</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- AI Acumen + Experience (2-column) -->
  <section class="resume-section">
    <div class="resume-inner">

      <!-- Left column -->
      <div class="resume-left">
        <div class="resume-block">
          <h2>AI Acumen.</h2>
          <p>Designing AI-native experiences and agentic workflows, providing strategic AI advisory across product domains, leading AI-assisted design ops and decision frameworks, and building custom AI tooling for design teams.</p>
          <p class="skill-label">AI tools</p>
          <p>Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, Figma Make, Cursor, Lovable, Writer, Copilot</p>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-block">
          <h2>Design Leadership.</h2>
          <p>Strategic design advisor and craft lead, mentor and team builder, driving cross-functional alignment, executive influence, and org-wide design rituals and operating models.</p>
          <p class="skill-label">Training</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Designing AI Experiences</li>
            <li>Principles of Management</li>
            <li>Storytelling with Impact</li>
            <li>Workplace Influence &amp; Executive Presence</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-block">
          <h2>Education.</h2>
          <ul class="edu-list">
            <li><strong>UX Design — Cert.</strong><br/>UCSD Extension, 2017</li>
            <li><strong>Digital Art — B.S.</strong><br/>University of Oregon, 2011</li>
            <li><strong>Telecommunications — A.A.</strong><br/>Cuyamaca College, 2009</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-block">
          <h2>Design Community.</h2>
          <ul class="community-list">
            <li><strong>SD Design Trek</strong> — Co-Driver</li>
            <li><strong>SDXD</strong> — Advisor</li>
            <li><strong>UX Speakeasy</strong> — Volunteer</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-block">
          <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1N8M1njMHrf4aGNiAK3eerWg2W879O2ux/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-view-resume">View resume</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right column -->
      <div class="resume-right">
        <h2>Experience.</h2>
        <p class="experience-summary">Staff Product Designer with 10+ years of experience designing AI-native products and platforms at scale. At Intuit, I lead design for the Virtual Expert Platform, an in-house platform that powers expert and support experiences across every major Intuit business unit.</p>

        <div class="role">
          <h3>Staff Product Designer</h3>
          <p class="role-meta">Intuit, San Diego, CA | August 2023 – Present</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Lead designer for Concierge, influencing 53% of conversions and supporting 5,500 daily calls, contributing to $250M in revenue.</li>
            <li>Serve as strategic design advisor for AI initiatives across Sales and Customer Success.</li>
            <li>Led the agentic AI Tier-1 to Tier-2 support redesign: 40% YoY reduction in escalations and 24% deflection through gen-AI self-help.</li>
            <li>Led E2E design for the migration of 30,000+ TurboTax product support experts from Salesforce to IEP, handling 4M+ customer contacts with a 5% reduction in AHT and +1.1 tNPS.</li>
            <li>Co-founded VEP Creative Studio; co-lead weekly design crit forum mentoring 7 designers (2 converted from contractor to FTE).</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="role">
          <h3>Senior Product Designer</h3>
          <p class="role-meta">Intuit, San Diego, CA | August 2021 – August 2023</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Design leader across Virtual Expert Platform initiatives, building platform-level AI-assisted workflows.</li>
            <li>Design leader for Accelerate the Platform (Credit Karma) across CUI, search, messaging, community, and live expert access.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="role">
          <h3>Interaction Designer III</h3>
          <p class="role-meta">Intuit, San Diego, CA | August 2020 – August 2021</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Designer for the Virtual Expert Platform across TurboTax, QuickBooks, Mint, and Intuit Accountants.</li>
            <li>Owned E2E design strategy for OHH and Community. Converted to full-time Senior Product Designer in 2021.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="role">
          <h3>Lead UX Designer</h3>
          <p class="role-meta">National University System, San Diego, CA | March 2016 – July 2020</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Led UX design across four universities and five affiliates, driving top-of-funnel conversion.</li>
            <li>Redesigned CityU's website — 212% spike in RFI submissions within the first week of launch.</li>
            <li>Simplified National University's 14-step application to a 3-step mobile-first experience, driving 21.5% YoY increase in new leads.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="role">
          <h3>Interactive Designer II</h3>
          <p class="role-meta">L7 Creative, Carlsbad, CA | May 2015 – February 2016</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Designed E2E experiences across e-commerce and B2B platforms — 73% more leads and 188% more sessions for a solar client.</li>
            <li>Recognized by Graphic Design USA with American Web Design and Health + Wellness Design awards.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* ─── The work ──────────────────────────── */
  .the-work {
    padding: 5vmax var(--gutter);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
  }

  .the-work-inner {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
    gap: 4vw;
  }

  .the-work h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
    padding-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .the-work-body p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  /* ─── Sizzle ────────────────────────────── */
  .sizzle-section {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 5vmax var(--gutter);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .sizzle-inner {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .sizzle-section h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    color: var(--white);
    font-style: italic;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .sizzle-section p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;

    margin: 0 auto;
    opacity: 0.85;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .sizzle-video {
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 56.25%;
    height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .sizzle-video iframe {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 0;
  }

  /* ─── Outside of work ───────────────────── */
  .outside-section {
    padding: 5vmax var(--gutter);
  }

  .outside-inner {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4vw;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .outside-text h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2vw, 1.75rem);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .outside-text p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .outside-photo-small figure { margin: 0; }

  .outside-photo-small img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 570px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: top;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  figcaption {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #888;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    font-style: italic;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* ─── Full-width photo banner ────────────── */
  .outside-banner {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .outside-banner img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 520px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center center;
    display: block;
  }

  .outside-banner::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
  }

  .outside-banner-text {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 2rem var(--gutter);
  }

  .outside-banner-text p {
    color: var(--white);
    font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  /* ─── Resume section ────────────────────── */
  .resume-section {
    padding: 5vmax var(--gutter);
  }

  .resume-inner {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
    gap: 5vw;
    align-items: start;
  }

  /* Left */
  .resume-left { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2.5rem; }

  .resume-block h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .resume-block p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .skill-label {
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 0.75rem !important;
  }

  .resume-block ul {
    list-style: none;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .edu-list li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }

  .btn-view-resume {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: 'Almarai', sans-serif;
    transition: opacity 0.15s;
  }

  .btn-view-resume:hover { opacity: 0.85; }

  /* Right */
  .resume-right h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2vw, 1.75rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .experience-summary {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    
  }

  .role {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
  }

  .role:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .role h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .role-meta {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .role ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .role li { margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .the-work-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .outside-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .resume-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .outside-banner img { height: 320px; }
    .outside-banner-text p { font-size: 1.3rem; }
  }
</style>
